<title>FINLAND: Valmet wins FIM 110 mln Chinese order.</title>
<headline>Valmet wins FIM 110 mln Chinese order.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said in a statement on Monday it won an order worth about 110 million markka for the delivery of a specialty paper machine to Chinese Zhanjiang Guanhao Papoer Industry Co.  </p>
<p>&quot;The order will strengthen significantly Valmet's foothold on China's growing paper machine markets,&quot; Valmet said.</p>
<p>The new specialty paper machine would have an output capacity of 150 tonnes per day, and main deliveries from Finland would be shipped in April 1998, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
